---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>About — Hypn0s Cyber</title>
</head>
<body>
  <Header />
  <main class="container" style="padding-top:3rem; padding-bottom:5rem;">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="divider">◆ ◆ ◆</div>

    <p>
      Hypn0s Cyber is a personnal project I was exicted to start, basically a mix of my blog where I post 
      CTF/HTB write-ups, home lab projects and research, whatever I feel like sharing regarding my cybersecurity journey.
      Plus, my main focus, is to create a newsletter filled with a hands-on training room to try each week and
      cyber news without the noise for everyone interested in cybersecurity to have a place to learn more.
    </p>
    <p>
      It's built for people who don't have time to read every feed themselves, students
      breaking into the field, professionals who want the short version, and anyone who'd
      rather learn by following someone actually doing the work.
    </p>

    <div class="divider">◆ ◆ ◆</div>

    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>
      Curious ethical hacker trying to find a way into professional penetration testing as a main job,
      I love trying to find new ways of breaking and understanding stuff. If I'm not behind my computer
      or dismantling my router, you'll probably find me at a cyber event... <br />
      <br />
      Feel free to connect with me on LinkedIn and say hi :)

    </p>

    <div class="divider">◆ ◆ ◆</div>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
      <a href="/blog/">Read the blog</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="/newsletter/">Browse the newsletter</a>
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</body>
</html>

